  "description": [
    "A benzimidazolecarboxylic acid that is 1<em>H</em>-benzimidazole-7-carboxylic acid substituted by an ethoxy group at position 2 and a ({2'-(1<em>H</em>-tetrazol-5-yl)[1,1'-biphenyl]-4-yl}methyl) group at position 1. It is a angiotensin receptor antagonist used for the treatment of hypertension."
